  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/CafetedriaLaPanderolaOnda.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;\">(12 fotos) Este verano puedes degustar los mejores y m&aacute;s variados helados en cafeter&iacute;a La Panderola, en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a de Onda. Tambien los granizados m&aacute;s buenos, incluso de caf&eacute; desafeinado. Adem&aacute;s, elegir entre sus dos terrazas, una cubierta y la otra totalmente al aire libre, donde comerte un buen bocata o saborear un gran caf&eacute;.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialapanderolaestiu17/cafetedrialapanderolaonda.jpg\" alt=\"cafetedrialapanderolaonda\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialapanderolaestiu17/img_8262.jpg\" alt=\"img_8262\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialapanderolaestiu17/img_8263.jpg\" alt=\"img_8263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialapanderolaestiu17/img_8265.jpg\" alt=\"img_8265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialapanderolaestiu17/img_8266.jpg\" alt=\"img_8266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialapanderolaestiu17/img_8267.jpg\" alt=\"img_8267\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialapanderolaestiu17/img_8269.jpg\" alt=\"img_8269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeterialapanderol